### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Register a student
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane@university.edu",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Register a librarian (needs the secret key from .env)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register-librarian
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mr. Librarian",
  "email": "librarian@university.edu",
  "password": "secret123",
  "secretKey": "super-secret-librarian-key"
}

### Login (copy the token from the response into the @token var below)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "librarian@university.edu",
  "password": "secret123"
}

@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List books (public) -- with search + category
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books?search=algorithms&category=Computer Science

### Create a book (librarian only)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Introduction to Algorithms",
  "author": "Thomas H. Cormen",
  "isbn": "978-0262033848",
  "category": "Computer Science",
  "totalCopies": 10
}

### Update a book (librarian only)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/books/PUT_BOOK_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "totalCopies": 12
}

### Delete a book (librarian only)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/books/PUT_BOOK_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrow a book (student only)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/books/PUT_BOOK_ID_HERE/borrow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Return a book (student only)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/books/PUT_BOOK_ID_HERE/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My borrowing history (student only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books/my-history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All borrow records (librarian only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/librarian/borrow-records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Overdue report (librarian only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
